  "description": "Here's a 5-line summary of the conversation:\n\n1. **Modal redesign** \u2014 The `Modal.vue` component was improved with a modern design using DaisyUI and TailwindCSS.\n2. **Backdrop & layout** \u2014 A blurred backdrop, structured Header/Body/Footer slots, and responsive sizing were added.\n3. **Slot system** \u2014 Named slots (`title`, `footer`) were introduced for flexible content composition.\n4. **Scope prop** \u2014 A `scope` prop was added to allow attaching the modal to a specific DOM element.\n5. **Fallback & cleanup** \u2014 If no scope is provided, the modal mounts to the App root, and `beforeUnmount` handles safe DOM removal.",
