      "content": "Let me improve the Modal component with a better design using DaisyUI and TailwindCSS:\n\n```vue src/components/Modal.vue\n<script setup>\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <!-- Backdrop -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm\" @click=\"close && $emit('close')\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Modal Box -->\n    <div\n      v-bind=\"$attrs\"\n      class=\"relative z-10 bg-base-100 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-base-300 w-full max-w-lg max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col mx-4 animate-fade-in\"\n    >\n      <!-- Header -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-base-300\">\n        <slot name=\"title\">\n          <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-base-content\"></span>\n        </slot>\n        <button\n          v-if=\"close\"\n          class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm btn-circle text-base-content/60 hover:text-error transition-colors\"\n          @click=\"$emit('close')\"\n        >\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Body -->\n      <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-6 py-4\">\n        <slot></slot>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Footer -->\n      <div v-if=\"$slots.footer\" class=\"px-6 py-4 border-t border-base-300 flex justify-end gap-2\">\n        <slot name=\"footer\"></slot>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  inheritAttrs: false,\n  props: ['close'],\n  mounted() {\n    this.$root.$el.appendChild(this.$el)\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n### Key Improvements:\n\n- \ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f **Backdrop blur** \u2014 semi-transparent overlay with `backdrop-blur-sm` for a modern glassmorphism feel\n- \ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f **Click outside to close** \u2014 clicking the backdrop triggers close (when `close` prop is set)\n- \ud83e\uddf1 **Structured layout** \u2014 clear **Header / Body / Footer** slot sections\n- \ud83d\udccc **Named slots** \u2014 `title` slot for the header title, `footer` slot for action buttons (only rendered if used)\n- \ud83d\udcdc **Scrollable body** \u2014 content area scrolls independently with `overflow-y-auto`\n- \ud83d\udd18 **DaisyUI close button** \u2014 uses `btn btn-ghost btn-sm btn-circle` for a polished icon button\n- \ud83d\udcd0 **Better sizing** \u2014 `max-w-lg`, `max-h-[90vh]`, and `mx-4` for responsive centering\n- \ud83d\udd32 **Rounded & shadowed** \u2014 `rounded-2xl` and `shadow-2xl` for depth\n\n### Usage example:\n```vue\n<Modal :close=\"true\" @close=\"showModal = false\">\n  <template #title>My Modal Title</template>\n  \n  <p>Modal body content goes here.</p>\n\n  <template #footer>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" @click=\"showModal = false\">Cancel</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"confirm\">Confirm</button>\n  </template>\n</Modal>\n```",
